# The Three Magi (windurst 66): Chumimi's arm order across her three quests (GM-set states that make two arms open), a
# BLM 75. AF1_QUEST_LEVEL 100: The Three Magi available but not offered, Recollections and The Root of the Problem
# available: no 270 and no 276 (each needs the quest before it completed): her 259. AF1 40 again, Recollections
# accepted with Foe Finder MK I (GM): 260, not 275; option 3: begun. Accepted: 261, not 275; with
# The Root of the Problem accepted at var 1 too: 261, not 277. The Three Magi completed (GM): 275, not 277; its finish:
# Recollections completed. Then 277. The Three Magi available again with The Root of the Problem available (GM): 260,
# not 276; accepted: 261, not 276. The Three Magi completed, Recollections available, The Root of the Problem accepted
# at var 2 (GM): 270, not 279.
char zone=HeavensTower pos=0.0,30.75,21.5 job=BLM lvl=75
login
setting AF1_QUEST_LEVEL 100
trigger Chumimi                         # no 260 (AF1 100), no 270, no 276: her 259
finish
setting AF1_QUEST_LEVEL 40
quest Windurst.Recollections accepted   # GM
keyitem FoeFinderMkI
trigger Chumimi                         # 260 (before 275)
finish option=3                         # begun
trigger Chumimi                         # 261 (before 275)
finish
quest Windurst.TheRootOfTheProblem accepted  # GM
charvar rootProblem 1
trigger Chumimi                         # 261 (before 277)
finish
quest Windurst.TheThreeMagi completed   # GM
trigger Chumimi                         # 275 (before 277)
finish                                  # Wizard's Sabots; the key item taken; fame 20; Recollections completed
trigger Chumimi                         # The Root of the Problem accepted, var 1: 277
finish
quest Windurst.TheThreeMagi available   # GM
quest Windurst.TheRootOfTheProblem available  # GM
charvar rootProblem 0
trigger Chumimi                         # 260 (before 276)
finish option=2                         # begun
trigger Chumimi                         # 261 (before 276)
finish
quest Windurst.TheThreeMagi completed   # GM
quest Windurst.Recollections available  # GM
quest Windurst.TheRootOfTheProblem accepted  # GM
charvar rootProblem 2
trigger Chumimi                         # 270 (before 279)
finish option=0                         # Recollections begun
